function ignore value:
    replacement:
        @intrinsic("discard", value)

[an|] integer means: @intrinsic("type", "int")

[a|] boolean means: @intrinsic("type", "bool")

fixed quantity means: @intrinsic("fix", quantity)

to get the value selected from [a number equal to {integer:value}|a flag equal to {boolean:value}]:
	@intrinsic("return", value)

ignore the value selected from a number equal to 6
ignore the value selected from a flag equal to @intrinsic("equal", 1, 1)

to get the value selected in [fixed mode from {fixed integer:value}|runtime mode from {integer:value}]:
	@intrinsic("return", value)

ignore the value selected in fixed mode from 7
ignore the value selected in runtime mode from 8
